      "f8383fbb79eba2fbf7bd5d688622d5125cc6b6ae8bd283bc9c32ba28e0f0fa2f",
      :raw
      "- `S1`, `S2`, `SAFE10`, `SAFE11`, `R11`, and `R12` define schemas,\n  serialization, capabilities, taint, runtime enforcement, and redaction.\n",
      :source-occurrence-id
      "S8/source/6caf6f1ac3f3d44596b756575e0924e9645e44f476923c46fd48dd9800481ac3",
